Turn the supplied script into a three-scene narrated video plan. Return ONLY valid JSON, no Markdown, using exactly this shape:
{"scenes":[{"narration":"...","image_prompt":"..."},{"narration":"...","image_prompt":"..."},{"narration":"...","image_prompt":"..."}]}
Write English narration that sounds natural when spoken: 25 to 40 words per scene, short sentences, no headings or stage directions. Keep the facts in the source script. Each image_prompt must be a concrete English description of a simple educational illustration. Give all images the same flat style, navy and turquoise palette and white background. Ask for no text, no letters and no logos. The illustrations are visual metaphors, not precise network diagrams.
